                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Farao naakasika afwaafwi, bana ba-Israyeli bakatambya meso aabo, babona kuti ba-Egepita beza bubatobela. Mpawo bana ba-Israyeli bakayoowa loko, akukwiilila Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
