        {
          "text": "Elyo Musa wakatandabika ijanza lyakwe atala alwizi, nkabela masiku oonse Jehova wakapilusya maanzi aalwizi amuuwo muyumu wakujwe, mane kwakaboneka nyika injumu akati kalwizi, amaanzi akapambukana. ",
